=== Prompt ===
Who is Pikachu?

=== Response ===
Pikachu is a fictional character from the Pokémon franchise. He is one of the most recognizable and popular Pokémon characters, known for his distinctive yellow fur, large cheeks, and iconic lightning bolt-shaped tail. Pikachu is often depicted as an electric-type Pokémon and serves as the mascot of the Pokémon franchise.

In the anime, manga, video games, and other media, Pikachu is portrayed as a loyal, brave, and somewhat mischievous Pokémon who is Ash Ketchum's first and best friend. Pikachu has become a cultural icon and is featured in numerous products, from toys to clothing, and is loved by fans around the world.

